                "text": "If Congress fails to act, millions of Americans will see their health insurance premiums skyrocket. Each day House Republicans refuse to do their job, we inch closer to the point of no return.\n\nI\u2019m ready to work with anyone ready to open the government while saving health care for millions of Americans.",
