                "text": "Federal workers aren\u2019t getting paid. Service members don\u2019t know if their next paycheck will come. Millions are about to be priced out of their health insurance. And House Republicans? They\u2019re on a 6-week vacation. That\u2019s not leadership. It\u2019s a total betrayal of duty.",
