                "text": "Washington Republicans will be entirely to blame if healthcare premiums jump. Extending ACA credits would prevent huge price hikes. The American people know who has been fighting to protect and strengthen healthcare, and who has been trying to kneecap the ACA for 15 years. When costs rise, Republicans chose it and will own it.\n\nhttps://t.co/ZefhEpTrty",
